---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
---

<PageLayout
    title="Privacy - Philippine Villard"
    description="Privacy policy of Philippine Villard's website: no analytics, no cookies, no forms."
    currentPath={Astro.url.pathname}
>
    <Section>
        <article class="legal bento-card">
            <h1>Privacy</h1>

            <h2>What this website collects</h2>
            <p>
                Nothing. This website uses no cookies, no analytics and no forms, and loads nothing from other websites
                (fonts and images included).
            </p>
            <p>
                Two preferences may be saved in your own browser (local storage): the light or dark theme, and the
                dismissal of the information banner. They never leave your device and you can clear them at any time
                from your browser settings.
            </p>

            <h2>Hosting</h2>
            <p>
                Like any host, GitHub (which serves this website) receives the IP address of visitors to deliver the pages
                and protect its service. This processing is GitHub's responsibility, described in its
                <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">privacy statement</a>.
            </p>

            <h2>If you write to me</h2>
            <p>
                Messages sent to <a href="mailto:philippine.villard@hotmail.com">philippine.villard@hotmail.com</a> are
                only used to answer you and are never passed on.
            </p>

            <h2>Your rights</h2>
            <p>
                For any question about your data, or to request access to, correction or deletion of an exchange,
                write to the address above. You may also lodge a complaint with the French data protection authority
                (<a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en">CNIL</a>).
            </p>
        </article>
    </Section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
    .legal {
        max-width: 72ch;
        margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .legal h2 {
        font-size: var(--text-lg);
        margin-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-3);
    }

    .legal p {
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal p + p {
        margin-top: var(--space-3);
    }
</style>
